  "Not saved: the database does not have the table hlstats_gamewe_hall_of_fame yet. Update the collector (gamewe db migrate creates it).": "Ikke gemt: databasen har endnu ikke tabellen hlstats_gamewe_hall_of_fame. Opdatér collectoren (gamewe db migrate opretter den).",
  "From the console: gamewe halloffame schedule {g} [EVERY|off|inherit] -mode MODE": "Fra konsollen: gamewe halloffame schedule {g} [EVERY|off|inherit] -mode MODE",
  "What the collector does next, what is waiting or running right now and what it did last.": "Hvad collectoren gør næste gang, hvad der venter eller kører lige nu, og hvad den gjorde sidst.",
  "The collector is not running right now. Planned and waiting jobs only run once it runs again.": "Collectoren kører ikke lige nu. Planlagte og ventende jobs kører først, når den kører igen.",
  "Next up": "Næste",
  "The collector reports the times of its daily jobs from version 0.27.0. Until then the times of the awards and the inactive players are missing here.": "Collectoren melder tidspunkterne for sine daglige jobs fra version 0.27.0. Indtil da mangler tidspunkterne for priserne og de inaktive spillere her.",
  "Nothing planned: the daily jobs are off and no ranking has a scheduled reset.": "Intet planlagt: de daglige jobs er slået fra, og ingen rangliste har en planlagt nulstilling.",
