  "Everything, players too": "Alt, også spillerne",
  "for {d}": "for {d}",
  "all rankings": "alle ranglister",
  "{n} rankings": "{n} ranglister",
  "On the console: gamewe jobs (list), gamewe jobs -queue (queue).": "I konsollen: gamewe jobs (liste), gamewe jobs -queue (kø).",
  "The collector picks up a change within a minute.": "Collectoren overtager en ændring inden for et minut.",
  "Block VAC-banned players": "Blokér VAC-udelukkede spillere",
  "On: at every connect the collector asks the Steam Web API whether the player has a VAC ban on record, also from another game. Such players are kicked with \"VAC ban on record\", still get a profile, collect no points and are listed only on the bans page (yellow VAC). The servers need an RCON password. Without a Steam key or when Steam does not answer, nobody is blocked. Off (default): nothing is checked; running VAC blocks of this ranking end and the players are back in the ranking.": "Til: ved hver forbindelse spørger collectoren Steam Web API'et, om spilleren har en registreret VAC-udelukkelse, også fra et andet spil. Sådanne spillere smides ud med \"VAC ban on record\", får stadig en profil, samler ingen point og står kun på udelukkelsessiden (gul VAC). Serverne skal have en RCON-adgangskode. Uden Steam-nøgle, eller når Steam ikke svarer, blokeres ingen. Fra (standard): intet tjekkes; løbende VAC-blokeringer i denne rangliste ophører, og spillerne er tilbage i ranglisten.",
  "From the console: gamewe game set {g} -block-vac=true|false": "Fra konsollen: gamewe game set {g} -block-vac=true|false",
  "Own FastDL address": "Egen FastDL-adresse",
  "The folder above maps/ (sv_downloadurl), for this ranking only. Empty: the global address applies. Public addresses only (FASTDL_ALLOW_PRIVATE=1 allows private ones), no redirects, at most 512 MB download and 1 GB unpacked.": "Mappen over maps/ (sv_downloadurl), kun for denne rangliste. Tom: den globale adresse gælder. Kun offentlige adresser (FASTDL_ALLOW_PRIVATE=1 tillader private), ingen omdirigeringer, højst 512 MB download og 1 GB udpakket.",
  "What the download sends besides, for this ranking only. An empty field takes the value from Settings → Maps & events, which applies to all rankings. When this ranking sets a token or a user, only its own authentication applies; the token wins over the user. Over http:// token and password cross the network unencrypted.": "Hvad downloaden ellers sender, kun for denne rangliste. Et tomt felt tager værdien fra Indstillinger → Kort og hændelser, som gælder for alle ranglister. Når denne rangliste sætter en token eller en bruger, gælder kun dens egen godkendelse; tokenen vinder over brugeren. Over http:// går token og adgangskode ukrypteret over netværket.",
  "User-Agent": "User-Agent",
  "Referer": "Referer",
  "Bearer token": "Bearer-token",
  "User (basic auth)": "Bruger (basic auth)",
  "Password (basic auth)": "Adgangskode (basic auth)",
  "One more header (\"Name: value\")": "Endnu en header (\"Name: value\")",
  "Radar pictures by FastDL are switched off; the address works only with the switch on.": "Radarbilleder via FastDL er slået fra; adressen virker kun med kontakten slået til.",
  "To the settings": "Til indstillingerne",
  "Not a valid address: http(s) only, no user or password.": "Ikke en gyldig adresse: kun http(s), ingen bruger eller adgangskode.",
  "Please check the field \"{f}\": no control characters, a user without a colon, the header as \"Name: value\" (not Host, Authorization, User-Agent, Referer).": "Tjek feltet „{f}”: ingen kontroltegn, en bruger uden kolon, headeren som \"Name: value\" (ikke Host, Authorization, User-Agent, Referer).",
  "Edit hall of fame": "Redigér hall of fame",
  "Take entries out of the hall of fame here, e.g. a cheater. The players below move up, the podium shows the first three. Removed entries stay stored and can be brought back.": "Tag poster ud af hall of fame her, f.eks. en snyder. Spillerne nedenfor rykker op, podiet viser de tre første. Fjernede poster bevares og kan hentes tilbage.",
  "The collector is not updated yet: entries can be removed once gamewe db migrate has added the column removed (collector migration 16).": "Collectoren er endnu ikke opdateret: poster kan fjernes, når gamewe db migrate har tilføjet kolonnen removed (collectormigrering 16).",
  "No entries yet: the first come with this ranking's first scheduled reset (button \"Schedule\").": "Ingen poster endnu: de første kommer med ranglistens første planlagte nulstilling (knappen „Plan”).",
